# item_transform is signalled by every recompute (setters on plain scenes, update pass) but NOT while deferred;
# items of groups only flag a recompute instead of computing, so no signal until the update pass.
source s 100 100
scene main
add main s a
add main s b
group main g a b
log
pos a 1 1
log
update main
log
pos g 5 5
log
update main
log
defer_begin g
pos g 6 6
log
defer_end g
log
